Package: crossbuild-essential-powerpcspe
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, tabor-spe-toolchain:amd64 (= 8.5.0+tabor5), binutils-powerpc-linux-gnu:amd64, libc6-dev:powerpcspe, linux-libc-dev:amd64 (= 6.12.115-2+spe1), tabor-spe-libgcc-s1:powerpcspe (= 8.5.0+tabor1), tabor-spe-libstdc++6:powerpcspe (= 8.5.0+tabor1), tabor-spe-libatomic1:powerpcspe (= 8.5.0+tabor1), tabor-spe-libatomic-dev:powerpcspe (= 8.5.0+tabor1), dpkg-dev, make
Description: Experimental frozen Tabor SPE cross-build foundation
 Dependency-only entry point for the real packaged SPE compiler, cross-binutils,
 target libc development files and versioned universal Linux UAPI headers.
 The selected native SDK runs on amd64. This private port adapter contains no
 compiler or target runtime binaries and does not assert full libc acceptance.
